# Dealix — Omega V3 Agent Work Rules / قواعد عمل الوكلاء

## Read authority first / اقرأ السلطة أولاً
- nearest scoped `AGENTS.md`, then root `AGENTS.md` for repo conventions;
- `docs/agents/README.md` and `docs/agents/AGENT_TEAM_REGISTRY.md` for the human governance mirror;
- `dealix.agentic_holding.runtime.build_current_registry()` is the logical-agent roster authority;
- Session Factory + ResourceGovernor are the one modifying-execution/admission fabric;
- project/editor agent files are compatibility/execution surfaces, never fleet-size authority.

Canonical architecture:
`Dealix Holding -> Company Control Plane -> Sector Companies -> Arm Pods -> Specialist Logical Agents -> ResourceGovernor-bounded runtime workers`.

Historical `dealix-pm/sales/delivery/engineer/content` names are compatibility aliases only.

## Before editing / قبل التعديل
- resolve exact live base/head and preserve a source-movement guard;
- identify business impact and economic priority;
- identify effect class: safe L0-L4 internal/repo work vs exact action-bound L5;
- identify trusted data sensitivity; workers may never downgrade it for model capacity;
- identify acceptance commands and an independent verifier;
- use the admitted isolated worktree for modifying work; never direct-main mutation.

## Safe autonomous execution
Bounded L0-L4 source/test/verification work may proceed autonomously when admitted
by current authority. Do not wait for a routine permission prompt merely to run a
focused safe test or create a draft PR.

Material L5 remains separate exact authority: merge/release, production deploy or
migration, external send/publication, spend/payment/refund, binding quote/contract,
tender submission, DNS/DB/secrets/provider/billing mutation, root/destructive
operations.

## Model/data law
- automatic routing authority belongs only to the canonical Dealix model/cost/data broker;
- founder unattended policy: **NO_DEEPSEEK**;
- no silent paid spill;
- caller args, worker env, provider defaults, last-used model or self-authored receipts cannot mint authority;
- capacity never downgrades data sensitivity.

## Commercial law
`Free Execution Diagnostic -> Qualified Discovery -> Customer-Specific Quote -> Outcome Sprint/Pilot -> Proof Review -> Dealix Runtime | Stop | Expand | Redesign`.

No public fixed price/duration, fabricated proof, guaranteed outcome, cold WhatsApp,
automated personal LinkedIn, scraping, or unsupported compliance/residency claims.

## Never / ممنوع
- expose/commit secrets or a real `.env`;
- mutate main directly, force-push, merge or deploy production from a coding worker;
- disable/delete/weaken a fail-closed doctrine or authority regression to get green;
- create a second scheduler, work queue, Company Brain, Opportunity Graph, model router, approval center or Proof Ledger;
- send live outbound or create commercial truth from public research;
- invent customer/revenue/payment/proof state.

## Prefer / يُفضَّل
- exact-head isolated worktrees and bounded changes;
- deterministic scripts + focused tests;
- registry-derived logical ownership;
- Builder != Verifier;
- evidence/provenance on every material claim;
- repair existing canonical systems rather than adding frameworks or parallel stacks.

## Logical owner selection
Choose the canonical Agentic Holding sector/arm/specialist identity matching the
work. Compatibility aliases may front an editor session but do not constrain the
logical fleet. New sectors/arms/specialists are represented through the registry,
not by extending a fixed-five list.

## Verify governance
Hosted source lint:
`python scripts/audit_agent_team.py --strict`

Sovereign runtime acceptance (full app environment):
`python scripts/audit_agent_team.py --strict --require-dynamic-registry`

A real PASS requires current registry authority and zero orphan/unmapped failures;
file parity between Claude/Codex aliases is compatibility hygiene only.
